---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  seo={{
    title: "About Praveen — IT Operations Lead & Tech Automation Builder",
    description: "Learn about Praveen, an IT Operations Lead based in Dubai. Documenting real IT automation scripts, Windows troubleshooting, and verified technical guides.",
  }}
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:py-16">

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="mb-16 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-start">
      <div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-100 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-700 dark:bg-brand-900/40 dark:text-brand-300 mb-4">
          Building in Public • Dubai, UAE
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text dark:text-text-dark mb-4">
          Hi, I'm Praveen.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
          I'm a Web Administrator & IT Operations Lead managing 30+ servers, domain DNS, Cloudflare WAF, and automated production pipelines.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed">
          I use AI tools (DeepSeek, OpenCode, and Python CLI utilities) to build automation workflows, data scripts, and server tools. This site is where I document every real experiment honestly: what I asked the AI, what it produced, where it failed, and how I fixed it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Social & Quick Action Cards -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 shrink-0">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-brand-600 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white transition-all hover:bg-brand-700 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-600/20"
        >
          💬 Get in Touch
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://x.com/praveenwithapen"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-text-muted transition-all hover:border-brand-600 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-border-dark dark:text-text-dark-muted dark:hover:border-brand-400 dark:hover:text-brand-400"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
          @praveenwithapen
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/praveen-kumar-says/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-text-muted transition-all hover:border-brand-600 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-border-dark dark:text-text-dark-muted dark:hover:border-brand-400 dark:hover:text-brand-400"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
          LinkedIn Profile
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-border dark:border-border-dark mb-16" />

    <!-- Why This Site Exists -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-text dark:text-text-dark mb-4">Why PraveenTechWorld Exists</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Most technology blogs fall into two traps: overly academic textbook guides that assume complex background knowledge, or surface-level AI rewrites that offer no real, working code.
        </p>
        <p>
          I built PraveenTechWorld to solve real problems. Every guide published here comes from an actual incident on my dev machines or server infrastructure — such as a broken Docker volume, a stuck Windows update, a 301 redirect loop, or an automated python script.
        </p>
        <p>
          We skip the theory to focus entirely on tested terminal commands, reproducible fixes, and real automation code.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Core Pillars -->
    <section class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3 mb-16">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 dark:border-border-dark dark:bg-surface-dark">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-3 block">🛠️</span>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text dark:text-text-dark mb-2">Windows & IT Ops</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed">
          System diagnostics, registry tweaks, update error codes, GPO fixes, and server maintenance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 dark:border-border-dark dark:bg-surface-dark">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-3 block">⚙️</span>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text dark:text-text-dark mb-2">AI & Automation</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed">
          Python CLI tools, DeepSeek API pipelines, prompt engineering, and LLM automation scripts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 dark:border-border-dark dark:bg-surface-dark">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-3 block">🌐</span>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text dark:text-text-dark mb-2">Web Admin & SEO</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed">
          Cloudflare WAF, DNS/SSL management, GSC 301 redirects, IndexNow API, and technical SEO.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Banner -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-brand-600 p-8 text-white flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold mb-1">Need help with server administration or automation?</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/80">Explore our Web Administrator services or reach out directly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
        <a href="https://services.praveentechworld.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-brand-700 hover:bg-white/90 transition-all">
          Services ↗
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="rounded-xl border border-white/30 bg-white/10 px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-all">
          Contact Praveen
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
